        <mxCell id="Jkvz8yGXMy4LiYGSrAHR-9" value="Получить оценки рекомендации по критериям&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sub style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;c&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;из конфигурации&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
